// The mole rides a pressure tube: right mouse on a pressurised hopper with an empty paw seals it in a capsule.
// It is blown along the pipe (out of sight, unhurt inside the rock it runs through) and climbs out of the far
// hopper up on the ledge.
map
##############################
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#..............%.............#
#..............%.............#
#..............%##############
#...........###%##############
#...........###%##############
#...........###%##############
#...........###%##############
#...........###%##############
#...........###%##############
#...........###%##############
#...........###%##############
#...........###%##############
#...@.......###%##############
#######%%%%%%%%%##############
##############################
end
give TubeHopper 2
give CopperWire 4
place 2 5 0 TubeHopper           // on the pipe in the floor
place 2 14 -12 TubeHopper         // up on the ledge, beside the pipe's riser
wire 3 1 -2 5 -2
device 3 1 -2 Lever
use 5 1 -2
hold 10-30 right                  // walk over to the hopper
wield 31 none
use 40 5 -1                       // right mouse on it
expect 41 intube == 1
expect 60 intube == 1             // on its way
expect 120 intube == 0            // out at the other end
expect 120 px > 14
expect 120 py < 8                 // up on the ledge (the floor is at 17)
expect 160 grounded == 1
expect 160 hp > 99                // unhurt
